# What: adapt the pinned V8 rule helpers to Codex's engine configuration.
# Scope: bazel/defs.bzl and bazel/config/v8-target-cpu.bzl; the engine graph
# and dependency choices live in third_party/v8/engine.BUILD.bazel. ABI,
# runtime and CPU settings are internal outputs of artifact_profile.bzl.
# Preserve Chromium libc++ headers/runtime, Clang Windows driver flags, and
# the Windows target-ABI snapshot tool. The optional
# Linux backtrace link flag is omitted because that feature is fixed off.
# On a V8 pin change, review these hunks and build the native canary matrix.

